@startuml

title Claim Check: the bytes go to storage, the message carries the key

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber

participant "producer" as p
participant "storage" as s
queue "NATS" as bus
participant "consumer" as c

p -> s : PUT ores/<service>/<purpose>/<id> (the payload)
s --> p : stored
p -> bus : message with the key, the size and the count
bus -> c : the message
c -> s : GET the key (the caller's token)
s --> c : the payload, streamed
note over p, c : the message stays small and the key names exactly one object
@enduml
